;依頼ごとの口上を表示する部分は RETURN 0 を RETURN 1 にしてください
;--------------------------------------------------
SELECTCASE SCENE
CASE "依頼提示時"
	PRINTFORMW 「Hey, %CALLNAME:MASTER%... Listen, I, uhh... Sigh.」
	PRINTFORMDW It took her a few moments to respond because she had to take several deep breaths first. Maybe she was having trouble figuring out what to say next.
	PRINTFORMW 「How should I put it... You're always going around helping other people, right?」
	PRINTFORMW 「Well, sometimes when I see you doing that, I feel kind of jealous, y'know?」
	PRINTFORMW 「Like "Why doesn't %HE_SHE(MASTER)% ever look at me?" or something.」
	PRINTFORMDW Marisa says, looking down shyly.
	PRINTFORMW 「So I'll tell you now - and in no uncertain terms - I wanna have sex with you.」
	PRINTFORMDW Marisa hitches up her skirt to her belly, showing the pitiful state of her privates.
	PRINTFORMDW Whoa... That was definitely unexpected. What did she expect you to answer?! Wasn't that too forward of her? Did she really think that would work?
	PRINTFORMW 「I'm losing my mind, and I'm really scared... 'cause it's the only thing I can think about.」
